.TH QUIPU-DECK-ENROLL 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-deck\-enroll \- Enroll a Decision Deck credential
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu deck enroll\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-credential\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-cose\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-scheme\fR] [\fB\-\-expires\-at\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enroll a Decision Deck credential
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-credential\-id\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Base64url\-encoded WebAuthn credential ID
.TP
\fB\-\-cose\-key\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Base64url\-encoded COSE public key
.TP
\fB\-\-scheme\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Signature scheme
.TP
\fB\-\-expires\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Expiration time as Unix seconds
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
